@baseUrl = http://localhost/playstation/backend/public/api

### 1. Uji 200 OK - DEMO0001 (Budi: 2 console, huruf kecil + strip di nomor HP)
# Menguji normalisasi huruf kecil 'demo0001' dan format HP '0812-3456-7890'
# Total cost harus 51000 (16000 + 35000)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/track.php
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "booking_code": "DEMO0001",
  "phone": "081234567890"
}

### 2. Uji 200 OK - DEMO0002 (Sinta: Status Overdue)
# Timeline harus memuat Booked -> Rented -> Overdue
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/track.php
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "booking_code": "DEMO0002",
  "phone": "+62 823-4567-8901"
}

### 3. Uji 200 OK - DEMO0003 (Rafi: Status Returned)
# Timeline harus memuat Booked -> Rented -> Returned
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/track.php
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "booking_code": "DEMO0003",
  "phone": "083456789012"
}

### 4. Uji 404 NOT_FOUND - Kode Booking Benar, Nomor HP Salah
# Pesan error harus sama persis dengan saat kode booking tidak ada
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/track.php
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "booking_code": "DEMO0001",
  "phone": "089999999999"
}

### 5. Uji 422 VALIDATION_ERROR - Kode Booking Bukan 8 Karakter
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/track.php
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "booking_code": "DEMO1",
  "phone": "081234567890"
}
